CustomField.formula:
Suggested_Uplift_Goal__c
/* FIRST CHECK: The calculation will return no value if any of the following conditions are true for each line: - The product code of the renewed subscription contains the word "CONVERSION." - The renewed subscription field is empty. - The business motion opportunity field of the quote is equal to "MSP." If any of these conditions are true, the result will be 0.*****
IF( OR( IF( Contains( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.Product_Code__c, "CONVERSION"), true, false), ISBLANK( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__c ),SBQQ__Quote__r.Business_Motion_Oppty__c == "MSP"), 0,
/* SECOND CHECK If None of the Above Conditions are True: If the renewed subscription is part of a bundle: Calculate the Uplift Goal based on the ‘Bundle Customer Price’. This is done by: Dividing the ‘Bundle Customer Price’ (from Subscription) by the prorate multiplier. Then, applying the ‘Renewal Uplift’ on the Quote and adjusting for the difference in Partner Discounts.*****
IF( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__Bundle__c, (((( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.Bundle_Customer_Price__c / SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c ) * ( SBQQ__Quote__r.Renewal_Uplift_Percent__c + ( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__PartnerDiscount__c - SBQQ__PartnerDiscount__c )) )+( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.Bundle_Customer_Price__c / SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c)) * SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c),
/* THIRD CHECK If the Renewed Subscription is Not a Bundle and if the prior partner discount is less than or equal to the current partner discount: Calculate the uplift goal using the net price of the subscription: Divide the net price by the prorate multiplier. Apply the renewal uplift percentage.*****
IF( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__PartnerDiscount__c <= SBQQ__PartnerDiscount__c, (((( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__NetPrice__c / SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c ) * SBQQ__Quote__r.Renewal_Uplift_Percent__c )+( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__NetPrice__c / SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c)) * SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c),
/* FINAL CHECK If the any of the above condition does not apply, calculate the uplift goal as follows:*****
((((SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__NetPrice__c / SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c ) * ( SBQQ__Quote__r.Renewal_Uplift_Percent__c + ( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__PartnerDiscount__c - SBQQ__PartnerDiscount__c )) ) + ( SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__NetPrice__c / SBQQ__RenewedSubscription__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c)) * SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c) ) ) ) */
